er":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-23T17:52:26Z","updated_at":"2025-01-23T17:52:26Z","body":"Bisected to #90993, @darksylinc\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8b0373a6-427a-47ab-85a0-f34c8c15986b)\n\n<br>\n\nAs can be deduced by the culprit pr. the performance drop only happens with vulkan, with the compatibility renderer no lag happens. Also, i recommend compile without the `dev_build=yes` and with `production=yes` so you'll not lose some time with a wrong bisect 😄 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2610568282/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2611335126","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101905#issuecomment-2611335126","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101905","id":2611335126,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bpc_W","user":{"login":"darksylinc","id":3395130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTUxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3395130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc","html_url":"https://github.com/darksylinc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-24T01:11:26Z","updated_at":"2025-01-24T01:34:01Z","body":"Bisect is wrong.\n\nAncestor to my PR, i.e. commit 5ca419e32c can also repro the bug.\n\nPS: I'm testing on Linux with AMD GPU Radeon 6800 XT. Bug repros there too.\n\n**Edit:** Wait. Something's up. I see the same issue on 4.3 on Linux, but slightly different.\n**Edit:** Nevermind. I was wrong. Bisect was correct.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2611335126/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2611394103","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101905#issuecomment-2611394103","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101905","id":2611394103,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bprY3","user":{"login":"darksylinc","id":3395130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTUxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3395130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc","html_url":"https://github.com/darksylinc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-24T02:10:00Z","updated_at":"2025-01-24T02:10:00Z","body":"OK found the cause. I'll figure out the fix later:\n\nThe problem is in `RenderingDeviceDriverVulkan::buffer_create` which needed to change how buffers are created so we could send in the allocation callbacks.\n\nOriginally we just called (relevant code):\n\n```cpp\nalloc_create_info.usage = VMA_MEMORY_USAGE_AUTO_PREFER_HOST; // Relevant!\nVkResult err = vmaCreateBuffer(allocator, &create_info, &alloc_create_info, &vk_buffer, &allocation, &alloc_info);\n```\n\nBut now we do:\n\n```cpp\nVkResult err = vkCreateBuffer(vk_device, &create_info, VKC::get_allocation_callbacks(VK_OBJECT_TYPE_BUFFER), &vk_buffer);\nERR_FAIL_COND_V_MSG(err, BufferID(), \"Can't create buffer of size: \" + itos(p_size) + \", error \" + itos(err) + \".\");\nerr = vmaAllocateMemoryForBuffer(allocator, vk_buffer, &alloc_create_info, &allocation, &alloc_info);\nERR_FAIL_COND_V_MSG(err, BufferID(), \"Can't allocate memory for buffer of size: \" + itos(p_size) + \", error \" + itos(err) + \".\");\nerr = vmaBindBufferMemory2(allocator, allocation, 0, vk_buffer, NULL);\nERR_FAIL_COND_V_MSG(err, BufferID(), \"Can't bind memory to buffer of size: \" + itos(p_size) + \", error \" + itos(err) + \".\");\n```\n\nIt would seem this results in the wrong memory pool being chosen.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2611394103/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2611450675","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101905#issuecomment-2611450675","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101905","id":2611450675,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bp5Mz","user":{"login":"darksylinc","id":3395130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTUxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3395130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc","html_url":"https://github.com/darksylinc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-24T03:09:10Z","updated_at":"2025-01-24T03:09:10Z","body":"Submitted PR #101972 to fix this issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2611450675/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]